# Then use: REDIS_URL="redis://localhost:6379"

# Production Redis Setup (Recommended)
# Redis Cloud (Free tier available): https://redis.com/try-free/
# AWS ElastiCache: https://aws.amazon.com/elasticache/
# DigitalOcean Redis: https://www.digitalocean.com/products/managed-databases-redis/

# Webhook Security (Production Grade)
# Required for secure webhook processing from payment and authentication providers
# CLERK_WEBHOOK_SECRET: Get from Clerk Dashboard -> Webhooks -> your webhook endpoint
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET: Get from Stripe Dashboard -> Developers -> Webhooks -> your webhook endpoint
# 
# Security Features:
# - Cryptographic signature verification using HMAC-SHA256
# - Replay attack prevention with timestamp validation
# - Secure header parsing and validation
# - Comprehensive security event logging
# - Graceful degradation for development environments